  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Penny Sanderson is an Australian businesswoman who helped build Sea to Summit, the Perth outdoor-equipment brand, alongside her partner Roland Tyson. She joined after six years at Australian Geographic, bringing experience as a buyer. The business grew internationally before investment firm Five V Capital agreed to become its majority shareholder.",
    "html": "<p>Penny Sanderson is an Australian businesswoman who helped build Sea to Summit, the Perth outdoor-equipment brand, alongside her partner Roland Tyson. She joined after six years at Australian Geographic, bringing experience as a buyer. The business grew internationally before investment firm Five V Capital agreed to become its majority shareholder.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
